WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.297
A deputy’s name is not enough Aisha is appointed

00:00:04.363 --> 00:00:08.731
as deputy Before the later update that fact does

00:00:08.744 --> 00:00:13.639
not establish acceptance of this evening assignment Identify the

00:00:13.678 --> 00:00:17.849
evidence that would make transfer usable and distinguish administrative

00:00:17.902 --> 00:00:22.244
cover from responsibilities retained by the control room Naming

00:00:22.271 --> 00:00:24.928
a person or sending an attachment does not complete

00:00:24.955 --> 00:00:28.849
a handover Write the evidence needed for transfer and

00:00:28.942 --> 00:00:31.271
what stays with the independent control room
